## Performance and Rhetoric: Connecting to Your Work

**Course**: ENC 1101

**Instructor**: Glenn S. Ritchey III

Last session we mapped the KLF's rhetorical moves. Today we're using those moves as lenses. Your MA2 asks you to analyze a literacy practice you're already part of. Your MA3 will ask you to take your own writing and remake it in a new form. The KLF spent their entire career doing both — constantly. Today we figure out what that means for your work.

### What you'll do

1. Work through two focused discussions with your group

2. Share your findings with the class

